      "text": "Executive Order 11233  \nADLAI E. STEVENSON\nA s a mark o f respect to the memory o f A d lai E . Stevenson, it is \nhereby ordered, pursuant to the provisions o f Section 4 o f Procla­\nm ation 3044 o f March 1, 1954, that until interm ent the flag o f the  \nU nited States shall be flown at h alf-staff on a ll buildings, grounds and \nnaval vessels o f the Federal Government in  the D istrict o f Columbia \nand throughout the U nited States and its Territories and possessions.  \nI  also direct that the flag shall be flown at half-staff for the same length  \no f tim e at all U nited States embassies, legations, consular offices, and \nother fa cilities abroad, including all m ilitary fa cilities and naval  \nvessels and stations."
    }
  ],
